1. GRANT OF LICENSE
StereoWeave is distributed in two tiers within the commercial binary build:

(a) Free Core Tier (No License Key Required):
You are granted a non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to install
and execute the Free Core features (`probe`, `edid inspect`, `edid budget`,
`edid patch --dry-run`, `edid apply --dry-run`, `weave --out-layout dubois-anaglyph`,
and read-only MCP tools) for personal, evaluation, or commercial use.

(b) Pro Perpetual Tier (Valid Polar.sh License Key Required):
Upon purchase of a valid StereoWeave Pro license key, Raymond de Oliveira grants
you a perpetual, non-exclusive, non-transferable license for one (1) named
individual to activate and use all Pro features (checksum-valid EDID patch
output, macOS DisplayOverride apply/restore, full Metal GPU stereo/lenticular/
RGB-D DIBR weaving, hardware VideoToolbox MV-HEVC Spatial Video conversion,
and Pro MCP tools) on up to three (3) personal Apple Silicon macOS machines.
Pro licenses operate offline after activation with local key caching and zero
usage telemetry.

